  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-aws-blackbelt",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：AWS Black Belt服务\n\n一个提供 AWS Black Belt 在线研讨会搜索功能的模型上下文协议（MCP）服务器，支持通过关键词搜索研讨会内容并获取研讨会视频的文字记录。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **search_seminars** — Search AWS Black Belt seminars by keyword.\n\nArgs:\n    ctx: Context to access MCP features\n    query: Search keyword (e.g., \"machine learning\", \"lambda\", \"s3\")\n    sort_order: Sort order by published date - \"desc\" (newest first) or \"asc\" (oldest first)\n    limit: Maximum number of results to return (default: 10, max: 50)"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "Returns:\n    List of seminar information including title, date, PDF and YouTube links\n- **get_seminar_transcript** — Get transcript from seminar video. Note: Supported only in Japanese.\n\nArgs:\n    ctx: Context to access MCP features\n    youtube_url: YouTube video URL\n    language: Language code for transcript (default: \"ja\" for Japanese)\n\nReturns:\n    Seminar transcript"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-aws-blackbelt\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-aws-blackbelt\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
